#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Uploading Files.rst:4
msgid "Step 6: Uploading Files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Uploading Files.rst:6
msgid ""
"This step extends :ref:`Step 5 <CTest Dashboard Step 5>` by attaching files "
"to the build on CDash with the :command:`ctest_upload` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Uploading Files.rst:9
msgid "Step6/submit.cmake"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Uploading Files.rst:9
msgid ""
"# Bundle the logs from this run into an archive.\n"
"set(logs \"${CTEST_BINARY_DIRECTORY}/logs.tar.gz\")\n"
"file(ARCHIVE_CREATE\n"
"  OUTPUT \"${logs}\"\n"
"  PATHS \"${CTEST_BINARY_DIRECTORY}/Testing/Temporary\"\n"
"  FORMAT gnutar\n"
"  COMPRESSION GZip\n"
"  )\n"
"\n"
"# Upload extra files to be associated with this build on CDash.\n"
"ctest_upload(FILES\n"
"  \"${logs}\"\n"
"  \"${CTEST_SCRIPT_DIRECTORY}/cmake.url\"\n"
"  )\n"
"\n"
"ctest_submit()\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Uploading Files.rst:14
msgid ""
"The uploaded files appear on the build's page on CDash, where they can be "
"downloaded.  This step uploads two files:"
msgstr ""

